It is a standard wrist chronometer with a digital display. According to the chronometer, the current time is TIME. The back is engraved with the message "Good luck in the Patrol! Love, Mom and Dad."

Blather loses his last vestige of patience and drags you to the Feinstein's brig. He throws you in, and the door clangs shut behind you.

